    "id": "flatten-nested-transforms",
    "title": "Flatten nested transforms",
    "html": [
      "<!-- Explicit flat · default flattening -->\n<div class=\"grid (place-items:center) h(200) w(240)\n         max-w-full (perspective:400px)\">\n  <div id=\"target\"\n    class=\"relative h(104) w(144) b(2) b-solid b-violet-60\n           font-sm bg-violet-10 fg-violet-80\n           (transform:rotateY(32deg))\n           (transform-style:flat)\">\n    <span class=\"block p-xs\">Parent · 0</span>\n    <div id=\"front\"\n      class=\"absolute left-md top-xl grid (place-items:center)\n             h(80) w(120) b(2) b-solid b-blue-60\n             bg-blue-20 fg-blue-80\n             (transform:translateZ(48px))\">\n      Front · +48px\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
      "<!-- Opacity .8 · preserve-3d is flattened -->\n<div class=\"grid (place-items:center) h(200) w(240)\n         max-w-full (perspective:400px)\">\n  <div id=\"target\"\n    class=\"relative h(104) w(144) b(2) b-solid b-violet-60\n           font-sm bg-violet-10 fg-violet-80 (opacity:.8)\n           (transform:rotateY(32deg))\n           (transform-style:preserve-3d)\">\n    <span class=\"block p-xs\">Parent · 0</span>\n    <div id=\"front\"\n      class=\"absolute left-md top-xl grid (place-items:center)\n             h(80) w(120) b(2) b-solid b-blue-60\n             bg-blue-20 fg-blue-80\n             (transform:translateZ(48px))\">\n      Front · +48px\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
